  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Your hands burn white-hot as you touch an enemy, engulfing them in flames.</p><p>Reach out and touch an adjacent creature. It suffers <strong>1 Damage</strong> that ignores <strong>Armor</strong> at the start of its turn.</p><p>Additionally, the creature must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or become <strong>Stunned</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can extend the duration of the spell by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.7hkYZvG9jSAPGcfv]{Searing Touch}</p>",
